# {{appName}} SDK - AI Agent Reference

## Installation

Add to your `Gemfile`:

```ruby
gem '{{gemName}}'
```

Then run:

```bash
bundle install
```

## Quick Start

```ruby
require '{{gemName}}'

client = {{moduleName}}::{{clientClassName}}.with_token('https://api.example.com', 'your-token')
```

## Authentication

All authentication is handled via `Authenticator` implementations passed to the client constructor.

### Bearer Token

```ruby
authenticator = {{moduleName}}::Auth::BearerAuthenticator.new('https://api.example.com', 'your-token')
client = {{moduleName}}::{{clientClassName}}.new(authenticator)
```

{{#hasBasicAuth}}
### Basic Auth

```ruby
authenticator = {{moduleName}}::Auth::BasicAuthenticator.new('https://api.example.com', 'username', 'password')
client = {{moduleName}}::{{clientClassName}}.new(authenticator)
```

{{/hasBasicAuth}}
{{#hasApiKeyAuth}}
### API Key

```ruby
authenticator = {{moduleName}}::Auth::ApiKeyAuthenticator.new(
  'https://api.example.com', 'key-name', 'key-value', {{moduleName}}::Auth::ApiKeyLocation::HEADER)
client = {{moduleName}}::{{clientClassName}}.new(authenticator)
```

{{/hasApiKeyAuth}}
