### OAuth2 Client Credentials

```ruby
authenticator = {{moduleName}}::Auth::OAuth::OAuth2ClientCredentialsAuthenticator.new(
  'https://api.example.com', 'client-id', 'client-secret', 'https://auth.example.com/token')
client = {{moduleName}}::{{clientClassName}}.new(authenticator)
```

